Package: nml-diag
Version: 0.8.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: NML <max.murphy11@gmail.com>
Section: synapse-peripherals
Priority: optional
Description: Read-only diagnostic listing for NML bench
 Collects boot-scoped application and server diagnostics during install.
 Writes a report to the data directories without restarting services or
 changing acquisition configuration. Installs one doc file.
